<title>POLAND: Polish Bauma sets issue price at PLN 10.</title>
<headline>Polish Bauma sets issue price at PLN 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction materials producer Bauma SA set the issue price of its 1.2 million-share initial public offering at 10 zlotys per share, the firm said in its issue prospectus.</p>
<p>It set the subscription period for January 16-24.</p>
<p>The company, which wants to enter the parallel market of the bourse, had a net profit of 418,900 zlotys on 15.4 million-zloty sales in 1995. It expects its net profit to rise to 1.5 million zlotys in 1996 and to 2.1 million next year on 14-million and 19.6-million sales in 1996 and 1997 respectively.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
